  "published": "2026-09-12",
  "updated": "2026-09-28",
  "description": "When an alert is created with a source IP, this playbook checks whether the address is public and, if it is, asks **VirusTotal** for its reputation.\n\nThe alert's severity is then set to *High* when more than three engines flag the IP, otherwise *Low*.\n\n### Why\n- Cuts manual lookups for the most common enrichment.\n- Private ranges are skipped so you don't burn API quota.\n\n```jinja\n{{ vars.source_ip | ipaddr('public') }}\n```",
